---
title: "Parent endpoint consent and exact input custody"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: held
  s1: pending
  s2: retry
  s3: accepted
  s4: Applied, no originals released
  s5: Applied receipt after restart
  s6: Applied, one original released
  s7: Both originals released
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: post card on child
  s0 --> s2: card needs retry
  s1 --> s3: owner approves the exact card
  s2 --> s1: owner retries from an original's channel
  s3 --> s4: apply once on parent endpoint
  s4 --> s5: restart with the durable receipt
  s4 --> s6: release one stored original
  s5 --> s4: replay the receipt
  s6 --> s5: restart with the durable receipt
  s6 --> s7: release one stored original
  s5 --> s6: replay the receipt
  s7 --> s5: restart with the durable receipt
  s5 --> s7: replay the receipt
